    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beela isa bara Abrahaam biyyichatti buʼe sana malee beelli biraa tokko ammas biyya sanatti buʼe; Yisihaaqis gara Geraaraa gara Abiimelek mooticha Filisxeem dhaqe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyos",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.26.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.26.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yisihaaqitti mulʼatee akkana jedhe; \"Biyya ani akka ati keessa jiraattuuf sitti himu keessa jiraadhu malee Gibxitti gad hin buʼin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biyyuma kana jiraadhu; ani si wajjin nan taʼa; sin eebbisas; biyya kana hunda sii fi sanyii keetiif nan kennaatii. Ani kakuun abbaa kee Abrahaamiif kakadhe sana nan guuta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani akkuma urjiiwwan samii sanyii kee nan baayʼisa; biyya kana hundas isaaniif nan kenna; saboonni lafa irra jiran hundinuus karaa sanyii keetiitiin eebbifamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunis waan Abrahaam dubbii koo dhagaʼee fedhii koo, ajaja koo, labsii kootii fi seera koo eegeef.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yisihaaqis Geraaraa keessa jiraate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis yommuu namoonni biyya sanaa waaʼee niitii isaa isa gaafatanitti waan Ribqaan bareedduu taateef, \"Namoonni naannoo kanaa sababii isheetiif na ajjeesu taʼa\" jedhee yaaduudhaan, \"Isheen niitii koo ti\" jechuu sodaatee, \"Isheen obboleettii koo ti\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erga Yisihaaq yeroo dheeraa achi jiraatee booddee, Abiimelek mootichi Filisxeemii foddaa keessaan gad ilaale; utuu Yisihaaq niitii isaa Ribqaa hooqsuu arge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiimelekis Yisihaaqin ofitti waamee, \"Isheen dhugumaan niitii kee ti! Yoos ati maaliif, 'Isheen obboleettii koo ti' jette ree?\" jedheen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "GEN 26:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yisihaaqis, \"Waan ani sababii isheetiif lubbuu koo nan dhaba taʼa jedhee yaadeef\" jedhee deebiseef.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiimelek immoo, \"Wanni ati nutti hojjette kun maali? Utuu namoota kanneen keessaa tokko niitii kee wajjin ciisee jiraatee silaa ati yakka nutti fiddee turte\" jedheen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kana irratti Abiimelek, \"Namni namicha kana yookaan niitii isaa tuqu kam iyyuu dhugumaan ajjeefamuu qaba\" jedhee nama hundaaf ajaja kenne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yisihaaqis biyya sanatti midhaan facaafatee waan",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.26.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.26.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "isa eebbiseef baruma sana keessa dachaa dhibba galfate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis ni hore; hamma akka malee sooromuttis qabeenyi isaa ittuma fufee baayʼate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis bushaayee, loowwanii fi hojjettoota hedduu qaba ture; Filisxeemonnis isatti hinaafan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanaafuu Filisxeemonni boolla bishaanii hojjettoonni abbaa isaa bara Abrahaam keessa qotan hundatti biyyoo naqanii duuchan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiimelekis Yisihaaqiin, \"Ati baayʼee nu caalaa jabaatteertaatii nurraa deemi\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yisihaaq achii kaʼee sulula Geraaraa keessa qubatee achi jiraate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yisihaaqis boollawwan bishaanii bara abbaa isaa bara Abrahaam keessa qotaman kanneen Filisxeemonni erga Abrahaam duʼee booddee duuchan sana deebisee bane; innis maquma abbaan isaa kenneefii ture sanaan isaan waame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tajaajiltoonni Yisihaaq sulula sana keessatti lafa qotanii boolla bishaan burquu argatan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiksoonni Geraaraa, \"Bishaan kun kan keenya!\" jedhanii tiksoota Yisihaaq wajjin wal lolan. Kanaafuu inni sababii wal falmaniif boolla bishaanii sana, \"Eeseeq\" jedhee moggaase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ergasiis boolla bishaanii biraa qotan; isaan garuu boolla bishaanii sana irrattis wal lolan; kana irratti Yisihaaq boolla bishaanii sana \"Sixinaa\" jedhee moggaase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis achii kaʼee iddoo biraa dhaqee boolla bishaanii biraa achitti qote; namni tokko iyyuu isa irratti wal hin lolle. Innis, \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.26.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.26.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amma iddoo balʼaa nuu kenneera; nu biyyattii keessatti ni baayʼanna\" jechuudhaan Rehooboot jedheen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis achii kaʼee gara Bersheebaatti ol baʼe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyos",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.26.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.26.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "halkanuma sana isatti mulʼatee akkana jedheen; \"Ani Waaqa abbaa kee Abrahaam; ani waan si wajjin jiruuf hin sodaatin. Garbicha koo Abrahaamiif jedhees ani sin eebbisa; sanyii kees nan baayʼisa.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yisihaaq achitti iddoo aarsaa ijaaree maqaa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
